meta {
  name: S10 access
  seq: 10
}

docs {
  Story S10, TICK-336 (P3-35, TICK-620). A tenant admin reads and publishes an entity type's access policy and asks the explainer why a user can or cannot read a record. Needs `tools/seed.sh` (it publishes the default incident ACL through `nava-onboard reconcile-default-acl`). Story users: `admin@tenant-a` is tenant A's admin, `agent@tenant-a` is Alice, `agent@tenant-b` is Bob. Runs again on the same stack: S10.11 republishes the policy it read, unchanged, so each pass adds one ACL version and changes no decision.
}
